        "original_id": "691027b2-2c52-5bfd-b638-f6c099b83899",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Dui Purush (1945 film)\n- People: Subodh Mitra, Pankaj Mullick\n- Concepts: Bengali cinema, Hindi cinema, playback singing, Rabindra Sangeet\n\nFacts:\n- Pankaj Mullick was born on 10 May 1905.\n- Pankaj Mullick was a Bengali Indian music director and an early exponent of Rabindra Sangeet.\n- Pankaj Mullick was a pioneer of film music in Bengali cinema and Hindi cinema at the advent of playback singing.\n- In 1945, Dui Purush (Two Generations) was released as a Bengali-language epic family drama film.\n- Dui Purush was directed by Subodh Mitra.\n- Pankaj Mullick died on 19 February 1978.",
